{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Courier Life Simulator - (Alpha)\u00a0</i>puts you behind the wheel of a realistic delivery experience where logistics meets life simulation. Start your shift at the warehouse, load up your packages, and hit the road as a professional courier. Whether you're navigating tight city streets or managing your deliveries efficiently, every decision shapes your day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Shift</strong> \u2013 Log into your driver account, check available jobs, and prepare your van for a day of deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/4a19630f27f8dc0f9dc4c0a009076470.poster.avif?t=1761628140\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/4a19630f27f8dc0f9dc4c0a009076470.webm?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/4a19630f27f8dc0f9dc4c0a009076470.mp4?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load &amp; Deliver</strong> \u2013 Choose which packages to load into your van and decide which one to deliver next based on your cargo and location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/0de80195a894e140e41761769a9749ae.poster.avif?t=1761628140\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/0de80195a894e140e41761769a9749ae.webm?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/0de80195a894e140e41761769a9749ae.mp4?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warehouse Workflow</strong> \u2013 Return to the hub to end your shift, drop off the van, and transition back into your personal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/6f24cef56093ef6cd0ccbe2e624be8b1.poster.avif?t=1761628140\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/6f24cef56093ef6cd0ccbe2e624be8b1.webm?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/6f24cef56093ef6cd0ccbe2e624be8b1.mp4?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Life</strong> \u2013 Spend your earnings on new cars. Customize, and expand your lifestyle as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/db1a610c6c825e65440ebe42aafca4a2.poster.avif?t=1761628140\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/db1a610c6c825e65440ebe42aafca4a2.webm?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/db1a610c6c825e65440ebe42aafca4a2.mp4?t=1761628140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic courier job simulation focused on routine, responsibility, and freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open delivery system \u2014 choose what, when, and where to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world with economic opportunities outside your shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of job realism and lifestyle freedom, allowing you to create your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in Alpha:</strong> features, systems, and world content are being actively developed and expanded based on player feedback.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806380?t=1761628140","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806380?t=1761628140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/adeb9c16b3d735e9ecb671cff55720413720d98d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761628140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/adeb9c16b3d735e9ecb671cff55720413720d98d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761628140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Courier Life Simulator - (Alpha)\u00a0</i>puts you behind the wheel of a realistic delivery experience where logistics meets life simulation. Start your shift at the warehouse, load up your packages, and hit the road as a professional courier. Whether you're navigating tight city streets or managing your deliveries efficiently, every decision shapes your day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Your Shift</strong> \u2013 Log into your driver account, check available jobs, and prepare your van for a day of deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta